  "text": "At every moment, buyers post the most they'll pay, called **bids**, and sellers post the least they'll accept, called **asks**. Together they form the **order book**.\n\nWhile the best bid is below the best ask, nothing happens. A trade happens only when someone accepts the other side's price.",
