seed-v2 · seed-v2
Content
{
  "text": "The price changes whenever the balance changes. If more people want to buy than sell at today's price, buyers raise their bids and trades happen higher. If sellers rush out, they accept lower bids and the price falls.\n\nNothing inside the company has to change. What changed is what people **expect** from it.",
  "title": "Why the price moves"
}
